  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "這個感覺......真是讓人感到，十分熟悉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "阿米婭，是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "啊，啊，哈哈......是這樣......原來是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "我記住了，阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "我已經得到我想要的了。你們可以走了，快走哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "W......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "——你們，要留下來送死？我沒問題哦，你們愛怎麼樣就怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......撤回下城區。放他們走。塔露拉的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "算了，事情再拖下去，就要變得沒趣了。我很討厭無聊的，就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "我還是挺期待下次再會的哦，阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "還有——那個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "什麼——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "下次，我會從你身上得到真相的，{@Nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "再見~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......為什麼......她在......做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "整合運動......撤退了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "————已經超出了預定時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "立刻......撤回羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......我來......護送後方幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "去吧，阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "........."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "..............."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......頭兒......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "其他人呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "臨光杜賓她們，已經帶著阿米婭和Dr.{@nickname}突破了封鎖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "而留下來斷後的小隊的幹員們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "......都陣亡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "你我是最後兩個活著的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......我想起來了......那個......那個怪物塔露拉......僅僅一個人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "近衛們竟然眨眼間就像棋子一樣七零八落......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "那個怪物像捏螞蟻一樣捏碎了重裝幹員......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "別出聲。你傷得很重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "天災......！她就是天災的化身......否則，否則火力小組怎麼可能一瞬間被焚燒成灰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "明明見識過她的法術，我卻......我不能相信......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "慘叫......唔......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "少說點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......抱歉......我......我沒法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "冷靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "我幫你應急處理了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......頭兒......你的手......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "至少還有一隻是能用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......頭兒，逃吧。你的話，一定能夠殺出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "我們只拖了那個怪物幾分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}和阿米婭安全之前，我不能走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "我得先阻止那個怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "頭兒......我也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "你的命是我廢了一隻手換回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "哪怕你只能再活一分鐘，我也希望這隻手，至少也值一分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "我去去就回。照顧好自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "頭兒......我真......不爭氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "你們一定能實現......大家的願望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們......我......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "........阿米婭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "............阿米婭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "你怎麼了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......沒，沒什麼。只是剛才突然有些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......難受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "嗚......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "難受......嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
